# Build hygiene — keep host artifacts out of the Docker build context.
# Without this, COPY . . in Dockerfile.nuxt overwrites the alpine-installed
# node_modules with the host (Windows/pnpm) ones. That reintroduces pnpm's
# nested vite/esbuild (0.27.7) alongside the hoisted 0.28.1 binary, so
# `npm rebuild` fails esbuild's strict version check (and native deps like
# better-sqlite3 crash with Exec format error). Mirrors n_dh_w_fe_corp/gt.
node_modules
.nuxt
.output
.next
dist
.data
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
